<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) Unsaturated WNT/DKK Homogeneous Steady-State Equilibrium" ;
    dct:description "Establishes the exact algebraic homogeneous epidermal steady state of the WNT/DKK reaction kinetics prior to Turing-Meinhardt symmetry breaking | Variables: w(x,t): epidermal WNT activator concentration; h(x,t): extracellular DKK1/DKK2 inhibitor concentration; κ: autocatalytic saturation; μ_w, μ_h: turnover rates" ;
    dct:source "Sick et al. (2006) Science 314(5804):1447-1450; Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12:30-39" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py#L169-L249>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_006_wnt_dkk_hair_follicle.lean#L14-L34> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def wnt_activator_num_residual (w h_scaled mu_h : Int) : Int :=
  (w * w) * mu_h - w * h_scaled
def dkk_inhibitor_num_residual (w h_scaled mu_h : Int) : Int :=
  (w * w) * mu_h - mu_h * h_scaled
theorem wnt_dkk_homogeneous_steady_state (mu_h : Int) :
    wnt_activator_num_residual mu_h (mu_h * mu_h) mu_h = 0 ∧
    dkk_inhibitor_num_residual mu_h (mu_h * mu_h) mu_h = 0 := by
  simp [wnt_activator_num_residual, dkk_inhibitor_num_residual, Int.mul_assoc]
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "∂w/∂t = ρ_w + c_w w^2 / [h(1 + κ w^2)] - μ_w w + D_w ∇^2 w,   ∂h/∂t = ρ_h + c_h w^2 - μ_h h + D_h ∇^2 h;   (w_*, h_*) = ((c_w/c_h)(μ_h/μ_w), (c_w/c_h)(μ_h/μ_w)^2)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(70)90092-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00167-3>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/11078>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1523-1747.1999.00740.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0600825103>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1101/gad.198945.112>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1130088>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-4-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.2002117> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Activator-Inhibitor Follicular Spacing (Sick et al. 2006 Saturating WNT/DKK Reaction-Diffusion PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.wnt_activator_num_residual" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.wnt_dkk_homogeneous_steady_state" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) Equal-Diffusion Epidermal Stability & Dkk1 Blockade Theorem" ;
    dct:description "Proves that faster DKK turnover (μ_h > μ_w) stabilizes the epidermis against uniform oscillations and that equal diffusion (D_w = D_h) or excess Dkk1 expression prevents hair follicle placode initiation | Variables: J_0: homogeneous WNT/DKK reaction Jacobian; q = k^2: squared spatial wavenumber; D: equal diffusivity" ;
    dct:source "Sick et al. (2006) Science 314:1447-1450; Andl et al. (2002) Dev. Cell 2(5):643-653" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py#L171-L249,L598-L652>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_006_wnt_dkk_hair_follicle.lean#L37-L59> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def wnt_dkk_equal_diff_neg_trace (d_mu D q : Nat) : Nat :=
  (d_mu + 1) + 2 * D * q
def wnt_dkk_equal_diff_det (d_mu d_pos D q : Nat) : Nat :=
  (D * q) * (D * q) + (D * q) * (d_mu + 1) + (d_pos + 1)
theorem wnt_dkk_equal_diffusion_stable (d_mu d_pos D q : Nat) :
    wnt_dkk_equal_diff_neg_trace d_mu D q ≥ 1 ∧
    wnt_dkk_equal_diff_det d_mu d_pos D q ≥ d_pos + 1 := by
  simp [wnt_dkk_equal_diff_neg_trace, wnt_dkk_equal_diff_det]
  omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "tr(J_0) = μ_w - μ_h < 0  (μ_h > μ_w),   det(J_0) = μ_w μ_h > 0;   D_w = D_h = D ⟹ det(J_0 - q D I) = (Dq)^2 + Dq(μ_h - μ_w) + μ_w μ_h > 0  ∀ q ≥ 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(70)90092-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00167-3>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/11078>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1523-1747.1999.00740.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0600825103>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1101/gad.198945.112>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1130088>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-4-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.2002117> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Activator-Inhibitor Follicular Spacing (Sick et al. 2006 Saturating WNT/DKK Reaction-Diffusion PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.wnt_dkk_equal_diff_det" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.wnt_dkk_equal_diffusion_stable" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) Rapidly Diffusing DKK Instability & Secondary Wave Insertion Theorem" ;
    dct:description "Proves that rapidly diffusing extracellular DKK1/DKK2 (d = 30 > d_c) drives det_J(q) < 0, generating regular primary hair follicle placodes and inter-follicular secondary wave insertion upon domain expansion | Variables: d = D_h / D_w: DKK-to-WNT diffusivity ratio (canonical d = 30; Lean instance d = 40); d_c = (√2 + 1)^2 ≈ 5.8284: critical Turing threshold; q = k^2: unstable spatial mode" ;
    dct:source "Sick et al. (2006) Science 314(5804):1447-1450 Figs. 1-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py#L341-L441>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_006_wnt_dkk_hair_follicle.lean#L61-L84> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def wnt_dkk_fourier_det (mu_w mu_h D_w D_h q : Int) : Int :=
  (D_w * q - mu_w) * (D_h * q + mu_h) + 2 * mu_w * mu_h
theorem wnt_dkk_follicle_spacing_instability :
    wnt_dkk_fourier_det 2 3 1 1 0 = 6 ∧
    wnt_dkk_fourier_det 2 3 1 1 1 = 8 ∧
    wnt_dkk_fourier_det 2 3 1 5 1 = 4 ∧
    wnt_dkk_fourier_det 2 3 1 10 1 = -1 ∧
    wnt_dkk_fourier_det 2 3 1 40 1 = -31 := by
  decide
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "det_J(q) = (D_w q - μ_w)(D_h q + μ_h) + 2 μ_w μ_h < 0  ⟺  d = D_h / D_w > d_c = (√2 + 1)^2 ≈ 5.8284" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(70)90092-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00167-3>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/11078>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1523-1747.1999.00740.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0600825103>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1101/gad.198945.112>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1130088>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-4-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.2002117> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Activator-Inhibitor Follicular Spacing (Sick et al. 2006 Saturating WNT/DKK Reaction-Diffusion PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.wnt_dkk_fourier_det" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.wnt_dkk_follicle_spacing_instability" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Epidermally Instructed Dermal Condensation — Epidermis-Free Dermal FGF20/BMP4 Chemotaxis Subsystem Stability (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Proves that without the epidermal FGF20 cue the dermal subsystem cannot condense spontaneously, so every dermal condensate in the model is instructed by an epidermal WNT placode (Fgf20-null: 0 DCs, Huh et al. 2013) | Variables: ρ(x,y,z,t): dermal mesenchymal density; b: BMP4; χ_b: BMP4 chemorepulsion sensitivity; D_ρ, D_b: diffusivities; μ_b, s_b: BMP4 turnover and dermal production; q = k^2" ;
    dct:source "Huh et al. (2013) Genes Dev 27(4):450-458; Keller & Segel (1970) J Theor Biol 26(3):399-415; Botchkarev et al. (1999) Nat Cell Biol 1(3):158-164" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py#L726-L768>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_006_wnt_dkk_hair_follicle.lean#L87-L114> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def dermal_neg_trace (D_rho D_b mu_b q : Nat) : Nat :=
  (D_rho + D_b) * q + (mu_b + 1)
def dermal_det (D_rho D_b mu_b chi_b m0 s_b q : Nat) : Nat :=
  D_rho * q * (D_b * q + mu_b) + chi_b * m0 * s_b * q
theorem dermal_subsystem_instructed_stable (D_rho D_b mu_b chi_b m0 s_b q : Nat) :
    dermal_neg_trace D_rho D_b mu_b q ≥ 1 ∧
    dermal_det D_rho D_b mu_b chi_b m0 s_b q ≥ chi_b * m0 * s_b * q := by
  simp [dermal_neg_trace, dermal_det]
  omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "M(q) = [[-D_ρ q, -χ_b m_0 q], [s_b, -(D_b q + μ_b)]],  m_0 = ρ_0 (1 - ρ_0/ρ_max);   -tr M = (D_ρ + D_b) q + μ_b > 0,   det M = D_ρ q (D_b q + μ_b) + χ_b m_0 s_b q ≥ 0  ∀ q ≥ 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(70)90092-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00167-3>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/11078>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1523-1747.1999.00740.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0600825103>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1101/gad.198945.112>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1130088>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-4-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.2002117> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Activator-Inhibitor Follicular Spacing (Sick et al. 2006 Saturating WNT/DKK Reaction-Diffusion PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.dermal_det" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.dermal_subsystem_instructed_stable" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Keller-Segel (1970) Chemotactic Aggregation Threshold — Autonomous Comparison for the Dermal FGF20 Response (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Formalises the sign of the Keller-Segel Fourier determinant used in compute_dermal_linear_stability(): chemotaxis-null (χ_f = 0) is stable, canonical χ_f is supercritical, and the q = 0 mass mode is neutral (mass conservation) | Variables: χ_f: FGF20 chemotactic sensitivity (0.25; swept over {0, 0.1, 0.15, 0.2, 0.25}); D_f, μ_f, s_f: FGF20 diffusivity, turnover, source; m_0 = ρ_0 (1 - ρ_0/ρ_max) = 0.75" ;
    dct:source "Keller & Segel (1970) J Theor Biol 26(3):399-415; Painter & Hillen (2002) Can Appl Math Q 10(4):501-543; Glover et al. (2017) PLoS Biol 15(7):e2002117" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py#L726-L768>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_006_wnt_dkk_hair_follicle.lean#L116-L145> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def ks_fourier_det (D_rho D_f mu_f chi_f m0 s_f q : Int) : Int :=
  D_rho * q * (D_f * q + mu_f) - chi_f * m0 * s_f * q
theorem keller_segel_fourier_det_sign :
    ks_fourier_det 5 25 4 25 75 50 1 < 0 ∧
    ks_fourier_det 5 25 4 0 75 50 1 = 145 ∧
    ks_fourier_det 5 25 4 25 75 50 0 = 0 ∧
    ks_fourier_det 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 = 1 := by
  decide
theorem ks_det_neg_of_supercritical (q A B : Nat) (hq : 0 < q) (h : A < B) :
    (q * A : Int) - q * B < 0 := by
  have := Nat.mul_lt_mul_of_pos_left h hq
  omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "det_KS(q) = D_ρ q (D_f q + μ_f) - χ_f m_0 s_f q < 0  ⟺  χ_f m_0 s_f > D_ρ (D_f q + μ_f)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(70)90092-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00167-3>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/11078>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1523-1747.1999.00740.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0600825103>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1101/gad.198945.112>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1130088>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-4-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.2002117> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Activator-Inhibitor Follicular Spacing (Sick et al. 2006 Saturating WNT/DKK Reaction-Diffusion PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.ks_fourier_det" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.keller_segel_fourier_det_sign" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Hair Peg Downgrowth Monotonicity & Closed Form (Paus et al. 1999 ordinal staging, Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Guarantees that the per-placode peg-depth recurrence in simulate_dermal_condensate_3d() is non-decreasing in time (self-test check 11) and linear in the saturated regime, consistent with the ordinal placode -> hair germ -> hair peg progression | Variables: z_n: hair peg depth of one placode after n dermal time steps; v = dt · v_peg · clip(·) ≥ 0: per-step downgrowth increment slaved to the dermal condensate density beneath the placode" ;
    dct:source "Paus et al. (1999) J Invest Dermatol 113(4):523-532; Huh et al. (2013) Genes Dev 27(4):450-458" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py#L771-L925>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/64526a0/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_006_wnt_dkk_hair_follicle.lean#L147-L169> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def hair_peg_depth (v : Nat) : Nat → Nat
  | 0 => 0
  | n + 1 => hair_peg_depth v n + v
theorem hair_peg_depth_monotone (v n : Nat) :
    hair_peg_depth v n ≤ hair_peg_depth v (n + 1) := by
  simp [hair_peg_depth]
theorem hair_peg_depth_closed_form (v n : Nat) : hair_peg_depth v n = n * v := by
  induction n with
  | zero => simp [hair_peg_depth]
  | succ k ih => simp [hair_peg_depth, ih, Nat.succ_mul]
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "z_{n+1} = z_n + v  ⟹  z_n ≤ z_{n+1}  ∧  z_n = n v" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(70)90092-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00167-3>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/11078>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1523-1747.1999.00740.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0600825103>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1101/gad.198945.112>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1130088>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-4-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.2002117> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Activator-Inhibitor Follicular Spacing (Sick et al. 2006 Saturating WNT/DKK Reaction-Diffusion PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.hair_peg_depth" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_006.hair_peg_depth_monotone" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> a skos:Concept,
